{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1551648-tattered-fa\u00e7ade","id":1551648,"title":"Tattered Fa\u00e7ade","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-06-13T03:31:27-07:00","id":1551648,"title":"Tattered Fa\u00e7ade","content":"<b>November 2025</b>, Tattered Fa\u00e7ade, the 17th hardcover release for Vampire: The Masquerade 5th editon by Renegade will come out<br /> <br /> <b>Features</b><ul><li>Who\u2019s out on the streets after sundown: victims, rivals, innocents, and monsters.</li> <li>Collaboratively build your city with <i>Night Maps</i>, and find new ways to hunt for 16 existing Predator types.</li> <li>Cruel new Archetypes for each Clan including <i>Mother's Boy, Crash Test Dummy, Scapegoat</i>, and more.</li> <li>More than <b>25 tempting new Discipline Powers, Rituals, Ceremonies, and Formulae, new Loresheets,</b> and a bargain with your Beast to master even more Discipline Powers.</li> <li>Intensify the terror in your game using existing rules for Touchstones, Stains, Humanity, Convictions, along with Ambitions &amp; Desires and Compulsions.</li> <li>New threats to the Masquerade, and to the Kindred, including the shapeshifting Gh\u016bl and the soulless Baali.</li> </ul>\u200bThe shapeshifting Gh\u016bl<br /> The soulless Baali.<br /> <br /> This caught my attention...<br /> What do you think, what are these Gh\u016bl will be?<br /> And the Baali... any ideas/theories how they will implement them?<br /> <br /> Any and all discusssion are wilcome!\u200b\u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-13T15:01:57-07:00","id":1551665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1551648-tattered-fa\u00e7ade#post1551648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you think, what are these Gh\u016bl will be?\u200b\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>What makes the most sense is the classic Arabian ghul that eats the dead. Its a predator that competes in the same niche that vampires do and thus represents a threat.<br /> <br /> In classic World of Darkness, this was only addressed as a Bygone in the Bygone Bestiary, and partially replicated through the Nagaraja. In my own chronicles, I have a fomori that also replicates this legendry (with a lot of influence by Lovecraft's ghouls).<br /> <br /> So I wouldn't be surprised if what another version of it comes up.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-15T14:19:50-07:00","id":1551686,"title":"","content":"Remember that the Gh\u00fbl eat living people, too, especially males (if just because women usually notice them in time to escape).<br /> <br /> Presenting the Baali as soulless may be an interesting change, lets see what they do with it, or if it will just be wordplay. I personally find the Baali as written in the old lore too asinine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}